I forgot my homework!"

7
00:00:28.522 --> 00:00:30.143
Terrell watched Roxy hurry away.

8
00:00:32.236 --> 00:00:32.756
"Hmm," he said.

9
00:00:32.776 --> 00:00:36.818
"I wonder He shook his head.

