The guards looked nervous.

18
00:01:04.264 --> 00:01:05.004
Roxy grinned.

19
00:01:05.784 --> 00:01:07.125
"Oh no, Detective!

20
00:01:07.765 --> 00:01:09.585
I didn't know you were sent to prison!"

21
00:01:10.786 --> 00:01:12.346
Detective Smith turned to Roxy.

22
00:01:13.387 --> 00:01:16.087
