23
00:01:16.687 --> 00:01:18.608
A very dangerous prisoner escaped."

24
00:01:18.628 --> 00:01:21.109
"I know," Roxy said.

25
00:01:21.969 --> 00:01:23.789
Detective Smith turned back to the guards.

26
00:01:23.809 --> 00:01:25.810
"So tell me about the prisoner.

27
00:01:26.390 --> 00:01:27.430
His name is Mr.

