43
00:02:04.277 --> 00:02:05.918
"I was leading Mr.

44
00:02:05.978 --> 00:02:07.239
Bubbles out of the prison.

45
00:02:07.739 --> 00:02:09.921
We were going to take him to a different prison.

46
00:02:10.881 --> 00:02:15.044
But when I stepped outside, his gang was waiting in the dark.

47
00:02:16.005 --> 00:02:16.925
They grabbed Mr.

48
00:02:16.985 --> 00:02:18.526
Bubbles and ran off."

49
00:02:22.009 --> 00:02:23.089
"Who is in his gang?"

50
00:02:23.310 --> 00:02:24.010
