51
00:02:24.030 --> 00:02:26.192
"Did you get a good look at any of them?"

52
00:02:27.252 --> 00:02:28.253
The first guard nodded.

53
00:02:28.273 --> 00:02:29.454
"We sure did.

54
00:02:30.094 --> 00:02:32.115
They were clowns too, just like Mr.

55
00:02:32.155 --> 00:02:34.737
Bubbles." "Gulp!"

56
