Detective Smith looked ill.

57
00:02:37.059 --> 00:02:39.341
"Detective, what is wrong with you today?"

58
00:02:39.681 --> 00:02:40.381
Roxy asked.

59
00:02:40.402 --> 00:02:42.583
"You're acting strange."

60
00:02:44.005 --> 00:02:45.926
Just then the detective's phone rang.

61
00:02:46.827 --> 00:02:48.889
It was in his pocket, but he didn't seem to hear it.

62
00:02:48.909 --> 00:02:51.951
"Detective Smith," Roxy said.

63
00:02:51.971 --> 00:02:53.993
"Your phone is ringing.

64
00:02:54.894 --> 00:02:56.075
