65
00:02:56.095 --> 00:02:59.558
"Huh?" Detective Smith suddenly looked at Roxy.

66
00:02:59.578 --> 00:03:01.659
"Oh! My phone.

67
00:03:01.880 --> 00:03:04.849
Right." The detective pulled his phone from his pocket.

68
00:03:04.869 --> 00:03:08.170
"Hello? What?

69
00:03:09.330 --> 00:03:11.210
Oh Um, okay.

70
